  "notes": [
    "Source SHA256 91b0c587a5a76e9a8f38217e0b304136ef298118a99b69cc743899fc4b16e428; Slumbot-free anchor SHA256 457d3babb82cb8014a2b7c378b2b5f916962565e63a44d192d5d7acd8393d6e7; corrected-CFR96 SHA256 902a7049ca66c0552246d11fe482eed4df47ac5c675ddf051c34ed86dcf213a6.",
    "First contract smoke failed before rollout because Standard10 contains preflop_policy_head weights but the target architecture omitted --separate-preflop-head. Strict loader prevented any environment hands or trained checkpoint; rerun adds the behavior-preserving architecture flag.",
    "Corrected contract smoke completed 292 fresh hands. Frozen-base plus zero-output adapters loaded; source ref-KL 2.16e-5 after one update, ratio max 1.027, all-in fraction 0.7%, and assignment provenance record SHA b5607a3e63e2ae31865df6559e1cf3d07f9b3d46d1994143a933d5c2e4690b64.",
    "Production milestone iter16 reached without PPO clipping or KL stop; first frozen archive retained for predeclared learning-curve evaluation.",
    "Production iter32 frozen archive retained; run continued unchanged after trust-region and action-mix health checks.",
    "Production iter48 frozen archive retained; transient reference-KL rise reversed without intervention or action-distribution collapse.",
    "Production completed normally at 263608 hands/64 iterations. Assignment provenance has 64/64 valid SHA256-linked records and monotone hand offsets. latest.pt and iter64 archive have identical 102 model tensors despite container-level serialization hashes differing.",
    "Predeclared curve was non-monotone and all discovery lower bounds crossed zero. Iter16 selected by highest discovery mean with narrower CI on tie; untouched seed confirmation achieved +0.647 bb/100 with lower95 +0.209 vs Standard10, motivating held-out-opponent generalization evaluation only.",
    "Held-out anchors were not used for checkpoint selection. Iter16 beat the 10M Slumbot-free anchor with lower95 +6.85 bb/100; corrected CFR96 direction was positive but inconclusive. Advance frozen iter16 only to a small fresh external Slumbot gate.",
    "Launched 8 fresh independent Slumbot sessions against frozen iter16 SHA256 05fe4eedb640f69617a277fe26fbec42bd4a138fe308785d237490163656eb91 after held-out internal gates; raw hand/dump JSONL retained per session.",
    "Live raw-evidence accounting checkpoint: 894 Slumbot hand JSONL rows across 8 active sessions; all stderr files empty.",
    "Half-run raw CI snapshot at 2487 hands: -66.75 bb/100 CI95 [-119.38,-14.12]. Scope remains fixed at requested 5000 hands; no early stop or policy change.",
    "Live raw-evidence accounting checkpoint: 3663/5000 Slumbot hands across all 8 original sessions; stderr remains empty and no session replacement occurred."
  ],
  "result": {
    "summary": "Adaptive opponent-league trust-region training completed 263,608 production hands with stable KL and action mix. Iter16 passed internal Standard10 confirmation and a held-out Slumbot-free anchor, but failed 5,000 fresh Slumbot hands at -53.86 bb/100, CI95 [-92.75,-14.97].",
    "conclusion": "Zero-initialized position-adapter-only PPO was operationally stable but did not improve general external poker strength. Sparse greedy mirror gains against related frozen networks were misleading: the selected policy was significantly losing to fresh Slumbot, with both SB and BB negative.",
    "decision": "REJECT_ADAPTER_ONLY_EXTERNAL_FAILURE_NO_SCALE",
    "next_step": "Do not scale this checkpoint or run 20k/100k Slumbot. Use the evidence to design a genuine full-policy or substantially broader learned-weight self-play/opponent-league update with an external-correlated validation gate; avoid selecting primarily on near-identical greedy mirror anchors."
  },
